{"title":"1984 IMO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb60e0857a2c0a2c47acfbe81781032feb1f7150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> be odd integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3dde70dfa7032f8dc030bce939e7954365990643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;a&lt;b&lt;c&lt;d$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/f/48f321bf029f7fb84615b987e2aaebb96e2c1537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ad=bc$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />. Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/e/dbe17a75e168e5f6de3be64a6d4fb7be6310d0ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d=2^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c1aeb3917188cdb5959f689199a3cbb4b746a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c=2^m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" /> for some integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56d1aa809cfad6667896f3ec4e2a1951b13a394c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:[1,b]\\rightarrow \\mathbb{R},\\ f(x)=x+\\dfrac{bc}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"226\" height=\"37\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53b7a54528b634d97cb6de07e37d67a2746b5273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^\\prime (x)=1-\\dfrac{bc}{x^2}\\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"150\" height=\"37\" />, we infer that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/6/396ded9b7014efff81a94e281d94b95dc71b62ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)\\ge f(b)=b+c,\\ \\forall x\\in [1,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"244\" height=\"18\" />; in particular, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8fc2319b6950456b7d077afdd11044fa0a77fa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d=f(a)\\ge b+c\\Leftrightarrow k\\ge m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"240\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/0315470efc923a02c2371120920b830d086e8281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ad=bc\\Leftrightarrow a(2^k-a)=b(2^m-b)\\Leftrightarrow (b-a)(a+b)=2^m(b-2^{k-m}a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"531\" height=\"20\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acd3617c90bba3ae4ad25a628f1a6e488d691281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m|(b-a)(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />. It is easy to see that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/8396bfe1ef3285ddcf50f894609574d30fdc7384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y\\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/e/85ed362b452409b1e267a543b53eb3e91e7005a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(x\\pm y)\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/a/78a2813fab3f4370a2b2644163447b6ef32aae53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(x\\mp y)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/0/a000faf251e9011c2b520fa9f8181c6015bca203.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(b-a)\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/2/132d982a53057818aab04775432fbab659ca0d82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(a+b)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1c48d7aee91d813e2df1f2b5e351c9b6dc9230e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(b-a)\\ge m-1\\Rightarrow b&gt;2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"239\" height=\"19\" />, which is in contradiction with the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/b/fabb70450d1b0b3a1e6eeefa5dcab82c6675d295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;\\dfrac{b+c}{2}=2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"135\" height=\"37\" />. Thereby, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/e/d8e16516c6c5217dac820e6456bdcdf686ae70d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(a+b)\\ge m-1,\\ v_2(b-a)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"257\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e2b04dccb1ed0d4ba22003e1dbd742718bf14b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=2^{m-1}\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/b/3eb8d01f4167c1e867e26492e814fd1acf73a64e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha \\ge 2\\Rightarrow2^m\\le a+b&lt;b+c=2^m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"266\" height=\"15\" />, contradiction; so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/9/be945df0162320ff1c1c21e0334a374de869eeae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c01d497aee0bd1318ddf743a9e1844fe0d88c22d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=2\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />, or equivalently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/6266a253a113436f803f7aa322cb1a2dd50d8021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2^{m-2}-\\beta,\\ b=2^{m-2}+\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"223\" height=\"18\" /> ( <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b54b2efe5c5111c7e6c198528ba6ba294ae0bf8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/9/049b21a782cd079af83d38cc75f44327a53ab665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c=2\\Leftrightarrow b=c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"171\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe57293baaaf7dc7885f8a72022d55459853344e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c=4\\Leftrightarrow c=3,b=1\\Rightarrow a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"260\" height=\"16\" /> , contradiction )\n</p><p><br />\nSubstituting back, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79bbe3ad5ce6293efb324a65174470db6e389ea6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b-a)(a+b)=2^m(b-2^{k-m}a)\\Leftrightarrow 2^m\\beta=2^m(2^{m-2}+\\beta-2^{k-m}a)\\Leftrightarrow 2^{k-m}a=2^{m-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"650\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b54b2efe5c5111c7e6c198528ba6ba294ae0bf8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. Furthermore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2eb98934209b5871b86be48f576bfa3dfd51ad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2m-2$\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea93a18c52a93a623bd322a8c7d20325841e6c69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=2^{2m-2}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db6f9c9880dccdb2fd57f2987c4fdb6228cde56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(2^m-b)=2^{2m-2}-1\\Leftrightarrow \\left ( b-(2^{m-1}-1) \\right ) \\left ( b-(2^{m-1}+1)\\right )=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"499\" height=\"22\" /> which together with the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20afa9d430964d658067093a97b8f0e4a6865cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/43919235f1755a2fa46fcbbdbe6f2af3a196d9dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2^{m-1}-1,\\ c=2^{m-1}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"216\" height=\"18\" />, so the family of the solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faedb9d30dc3763d92cbcacf2cc17e2bf64f3e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> is described by the set\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/3/a339dacf3ed0c8e63596032c412d5fb8f6e3d1f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[M=\\{ \\left (1,2^{m-1}-1,2^{m-1}+1,2^{2m-2}-1 \\right )|\\ m\\in \\mathbb{N},m\\ge 3 \\}\\]\" width=\"448\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>This solution was posted and copyrighted by TheFunkyRabbit. The original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p4908989\">[1]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/151febd57430597520e9c582103029dcfcdafc62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\leqslant m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, then using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5ff758a3a22dabac4a4c04c0a0608acd6470028.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d\\leqslant b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/f/48f321bf029f7fb84615b987e2aaebb96e2c1537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ad=bc$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4854df79906539ad2c779422a6fb8e64c30c8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d-a)^2\\leqslant (c-b)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"19\" />, which is clearly impossible. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78de80eaafee6fca788bebc5b7ab2f16a7776b1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> must hold.\n</p><p>Next, observe that, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/274358de8146543d6c31d0f2bf94c2419842106f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c =2^m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20afa9d430964d658067093a97b8f0e4a6865cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e39f745c79b1ccf227bd517f2b41231330aec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />. Keeping this in mind, we now observe that, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa1d17c0b31f08c62c916116b7747aeba3acf41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc=b(2^m-b)=ad=a(2^k-a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" />, implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/a/4da888de827844f3dd1326a6b89894f28a2459c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\cdot 2^m - a\\cdot 2^k = (b-a)(b+a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"235\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/1/171d2b51c0347101d2d77184a8a89451114d4eb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m \\mid (b-a)(b+a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />. Now, note also that, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f1497a84ebaf41b1b6168db4c0fa56656c7fd9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d={\\rm gcd}(b-a,b+a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0fea71c57b26382b13182ea5d6be29ce6ce401f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d\\mid 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />, and thus, the largest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dividing either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c60c151331e235dc6d9df7ca403b6f0c9af39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62bdadf8cf9891bb42812ef0d8ebdfa6cc7feb9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> is exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/e/d4e8fa96f977e058cf50b59a9201feb1b6f51189.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a&lt;2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />, and thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/e/06e9380c9dde8647258cfe99172c1ae3ddf8845a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{m-1}\\mid b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"19\" />. Moreover, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/c/74c7ca01d2931276df069c509e740ec5bc1ca81e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a\\geqslant 2\\cdot 2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"17\" />, then we again have a contradiction, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/3/17351e6dcdaa6a78302a0dee1f4fb3a0b55cf8f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b,a&lt;2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/c/e9c47a7cc5d20f528c291e0f5b4dd17af0aaf117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a=2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />. This yields, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/2819bf403945b7576e8e1d383823ce448548e004.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a = 2(b-a\\cdot 2^{k-m})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" />, which brings us, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e88b3009c8b3d95a325fe56c219838ac4f6c808c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=(2^{k-m+1}-1)a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />. Now, using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f15beb21fd28e72deab75a50a499a48f213b089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a=2^{k-m+1}a = 2^{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"191\" height=\"17\" />, we immediately obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/f/5efbb1d1c7583ecd676a975bf58fc465d9e819e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2^{2m-k-2}$\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />. This immediately establishes (since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is odd), that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This solution was posted and copyrighted by grupyorum. The original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p12596064\">[2]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_IMO\" title=\"1984 IMO\">1984 IMO</a></b> (<b>